# Legion Mob Arena - PlaceholderAPI & Holograms Guide

## 📊 Available PlaceholderAPI Placeholders

### Player Stats Placeholders

Use these placeholders anywhere PlaceholderAPI is supported (scoreboard, chat, TAB, etc.):

| Placeholder | Description | Example Output |
|------------|-------------|----------------|
| `%legion_gems%` | Player's total gems | `150` |
| `%legion_highest_round%` | Highest round reached | `25` |
| `%legion_kills%` | Total mob kills | `1234` |
| `%legion_total_kills%` | Total mob kills (alias) | `1234` |
| `%legion_deaths%` | Total deaths | `45` |
| `%legion_total_deaths%` | Total deaths (alias) | `45` |
| `%legion_kdr%` | Kill/Death ratio | `27.42` |
| `%legion_games_played%` | Total games played | `89` |
| `%legion_wins%` | Total wins (completed round 50) | `12` |
| `%legion_games_won%` | Total wins (alias) | `12` |
| `%legion_winrate%` | Win percentage | `13.5` |
| `%legion_unlocked_kits%` | Number of unlocked kits | `5` |

### Leaderboard Placeholders

#### Top Kills Leaderboard
| Placeholder | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| `%legion_top_kills_1_name%` | 1st place player name |
| `%legion_top_kills_1_value%` | 1st place kill count |
| `%legion_top_kills_2_name%` | 2nd place player name |
| `%legion_top_kills_2_value%` | 2nd place kill count |
| ... | Continues up to position 10 |
| `%legion_top_kills_10_name%` | 10th place player name |
| `%legion_top_kills_10_value%` | 10th place kill count |

#### Top Games Played Leaderboard
| Placeholder | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| `%legion_top_games_1_name%` | 1st place player name |
| `%legion_top_games_1_value%` | 1st place games played |
| `%legion_top_games_2_name%` | 2nd place player name |
| `%legion_top_games_2_value%` | 2nd place games played |
| ... | Continues up to position 10 |
| `%legion_top_games_10_name%` | 10th place player name |
| `%legion_top_games_10_value%` | 10th place games played |

#### Top Wins Leaderboard
| Placeholder | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| `%legion_top_wins_1_name%` | 1st place player name |
| `%legion_top_wins_1_value%` | 1st place win count |
| `%legion_top_wins_2_name%` | 2nd place player name |
| `%legion_top_wins_2_value%` | 2nd place win count |
| ... | Continues up to position 10 |
| `%legion_top_wins_10_name%` | 10th place player name |
| `%legion_top_wins_10_value%` | 10th place win count |

